  (text
    "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N8 (no PSRAM, so GPIO35-37 are free), native USB, indicators"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15 12 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "eba4ed18-0bf1-5270-a4af-beb2b4cadf32"))
  (text
    "Straps: GPIO0 pulled up (hold BOOT at reset for download mode). GPIO45/46 held low by the lamp gate pull-downs (VDD_SPI 3.3 V, SPI boot).\nGPIO3 (JTAG strap) is ignored with the default eFuse. Analog inputs on ADC1 only: GPIO1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 9, 10 driver currents, GPIO8 battery.\nEnables and nSLEEP avoid GPIO18/19 (high glitch at power-up) and GPIO0/39/43/44 (pulled up at reset)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e4b4e078-7ee5-5643-8b8f-48c5135667ee"))
